Technical Spec: AI-to-AI Handoff (Fire & Crisis Use Case)
Scenario: Customer calling in panic due to a Fire emergency.
Architecture: Vapi Squad (Multi-Agent)

1. Agent 1: The First Responder (Screener)
Role: Intent Detection & Identity Verification (Passive).

System Prompt Logic:

Caller ID check karke seedha naam se greet karna: "Hello [Name], I hope you are safe."

Intent Trigger: Agar user "Aag" (Fire) ya "Emergency" bolta hai, toh bina kisi aur sawal ke Squad_Transfer trigger karna.

Handoff Payload:

customer_name: [Value]

detected_intent: "Fire_Emergency"

user_sentiment: "Panic/High"

2. The Handoff Mechanism (The 1.2s Bridge)
Context Injection: Handoff ke waqt Agent 2 ko pichli saari summary mil jati hai.

Transition Filler: Agent 1 transfer karte waqt bolta hai: "I am connecting you to our Emergency Crisis Specialist immediately, please stay on the line."

3. Agent 2: The Crisis Specialist (Empathy & Action)
Role: Situation Handling, Consolation, and Service Booking.

System Prompt Logic (The "Mai Hoon Yaha" Factor):

Empathy First: "Mr. [Name], mujhe pata chala aag lagi hai. Please ghabraiye mat, mai hoon yaha aapki madad ke liye. Sabse pehle bataiye, kya aap aur aapki family safe hain?"

Brand Integrity: Agar policy expired bhi hai, toh bhi assistance offer karni hai: "Aapki policy status abhi secondary hai, pehle aapki safety aur rehne ka intezam karte hain."

Tools & Action:

Hotel_Booking_API: Turant aas-paas ke hotel search karke book karna.

Emergency_Services_Alert: Fire station ya Ambulance ko coordinates bhejna.

4. Final Handoff: Human-in-the-Loop (HITL)
Agar hotel booking mein issue aaye ya user ko "Human Touch" chahiye, toh Agent 2 call transfer karta hai.

Summary for Human Agent: "User [Name] reporting fire at [Location]. Safety check done. Hotel booking in progress. Please finalize the claim."
